  "name": "Outliner: dismiss stale wiki-link suggestions",
  "description_html": "<p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\" data-id=\"bba4fe8c-fd8c-4466-95f5-30ced5992dbe\">Bug: In the Outliner editor, typing [[ opens the link suggestion correctly, but the suggestion can remain visible after the trigger is no longer valid. It should dismiss when continued typing makes the query invalid, when the opening brackets are deleted, or when moving the caret leaves the active trigger range—matching Obsidian's native suggest lifecycle.\\n\\nAcceptance: reproduce and verify in an isolated Obsidian/CDP runtime; do not close a valid active suggestion; add regression coverage for query and cursor invalidation.</p>",
